DATASET ATTRIBUTION & ACADEMIC USAGE NOTICE

The wholesale B2B ceramic distribution dataset (`datasetarule.xlsx`) and its
cleaned derivatives under `data/clean/` cover wholesale transactions from
2022-08-01 to 2023-12-30 (15,986 active rows: 15,840 positive sales lines +
146 separated `QTY = 0` return records across 237 B2B stores and 4 Sales POFs).

All preprocessing, entity normalization (`PISSCASO` -> `PICASSO`), basket
engineering (`Toko + Bulan` / `Toko + Minggu`), and statistical validation
steps are documented in `notebooks/01_data_cleaning_basket_engineering.ipynb`,
`notebooks/02_sota_association_rules_validation.ipynb`, and
`data/clean/data_dictionary.md`. Provided strictly for academic data mining
research and reproducible evaluation.
